      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\nA calm adult woman documentary narrator speaks alone in a clean recording studio. Her voice is warm, clear, natural, and measured. She says exactly: <d>[English] Beyond the winter ridge, the river begins its long journey toward the sea.</d> No additional words or speakers.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClose-miked dry studio narration with subtle natural breath; no room noise or sound effects.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.",
