      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 Audio Proxy",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Audio Proxy\n\nThis workflow uses MiniMax H3 as a native stereo audio generator. H3 still samples its joint audio/video latent, but the visual canvas is fixed at the core node minimum of **32×32** and the video decode branch is removed. Only `VAEDecodeAudio` and lossless `SaveAudio` remain.\n\n**Use it for**\n\n- dialogue, narration, announcements, ambience, foley, animal calls, and audio sketches\n- 5–15 second generations; longer durations are outside the verified trained range\n- exact dialogue inside `<d>[Language] ...</d>` tags, with the requested speaker, mood, recording environment, and background sound stated explicitly\n\n**Important**\n\n- Keep width and height at 32. Raising either value spends compute on a disposable visual stream.\n- This is prompt-only FL2VA generation. Use the R2V workflow when reference media must control a voice or sound.\n- H3 output can be mastered hot. Check loudness, true peak, and clipped samples before production delivery.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
